{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-target='computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-title='Visual C++'>\r\n\t\t\tVisual C++\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on WiX: Not availabe, 1. Single Project - Solution, OutPath, 2. Multi Project - Solution, and OutPath.","label":"WiX","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/windows","label":"Windows","url":"\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/windows"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVisual Studio 2008.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEditing Intermediate directory not feasible from within IDE - GUI.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEdit .wixproj file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMSBuild Variables available in .wixproj.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Configuration.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Platform.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>SolutionDir.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>SolutionName.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Not availabe<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>ProjectName.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>ProjectDir.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>1. Single Project - Solution<\/h2>\n\t<h2>OutPath<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\$(Platform)\\$(Configuration)\\$(SolutionName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>2. Multi Project - Solution<\/h2>\n\t<h2>OutPath<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\$(Platform)\\$(Configuration)\\$(SolutionName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVars.wxi file for PreCompile header variables.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;?if $(var.Platform)=x64 ?&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;?else?&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;?endif?&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;ItemGroup&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content Include=\"License.htm\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content &lt;Content Include=\"Resources\\Banner.bmp\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content &lt;Content Include=\"Resources\\Dialog.bmp\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content &lt;Content Include=\"Resources\\License.rtf\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content &lt;Content Include=\"Resources\\Manual.rtf\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Content &lt;Content Include=\"Vars.wxi\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;ItemGroup&gt; &lt;\/ItemGroup&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;\/ItemGroup&gt; &lt;ItemGroup&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Folder Include=\"Resources\" \/&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;ItemGroup&gt; &lt;\/ItemGroup&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\